                            <comment id="12789665" author="drew.farris" created="Sat, 12 Dec 2009 02:45:31 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;For the case of computeCentriod() in the kmeans package it appears to be resolved. It doesn&apos;t appear to be a problem in the canopy, fuzzykmeans or meanshift packages either, but even if it were it should probably be treated as a separate issue. &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
